{"title":"Glasswrought Colossus","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 44 Sand Elemental that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: carapaceFlat: 7 | regrowthFracPerSec: .015</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/fulgurite-shard\">Fulgurite Shard</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/glasswrought-colossus\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glasswrought-colossus?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glasswrought-colossus?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glasswrought-colossus?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glasswrought-colossus?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 7 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 7 looted corpses, 21 recorded drops, 2,781 total, 18–165 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"sand-core\" title=\"Sand Core - in 57% of 7 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 7 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dd2f532fec666b02e71c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Core</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">57% · 4/7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"fulgurite-shard\" title=\"Fulgurite Shard - in 57% of 7 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 4 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/bd84404c123fb8e4bf22.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fulgurite Shard</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">57% · 4/7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-arms\" title=\"Ogrewax Arms - in 14% of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dc8e655dbf47607bb61d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14% · 1/7</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Goo